flowchart TD
    intent["1. Buyer supplies outcome, budget and deadline"]
    facts["2. AI proposes requirements and product facts<br/>retain provenance and critical unknowns"]
    check["3. Deterministic configuration and readiness checks"]
    valid{"Critical constraints satisfied?"}
    revise["Show conflict / unknown / useful repair<br/>user or trusted evidence resolves it"]
    offer["4. Freeze merchant offer and material manifest<br/>merchant / variant / quantity / total / currency / expiry"]
    approve["5. Authenticated user accepts exact terms<br/>store consent and policy version"]
    create["6. Persist order-create intent, then call PayPal<br/>stable create key; store provider order ID"]
    buyerpp["7. Buyer approves the order at PayPal<br/>browser callback is a signal, not payment evidence"]
    commit["8. Recheck material version and authority<br/>atomic budget / inventory reservation + capture intent"]
    send["9. Worker dispatches capture outside DB transaction<br/>original order / body hash / stable capture key"]
    result{"Trusted outcome?"}
    unknown["Unknown: retain reservation and operation<br/>read back / exact retry under provider contract<br/>never mint replacement authority on timeout"]
    declined["Terminal no-effect outcome<br/>record refusal; release only justified reservations<br/>show next action without fulfillment"]
    confirmed["10. Record verified completed capture<br/>match merchant, amount and currency"]
    outbox["11. Commit fulfillment outbox atomically<br/>unique purchase commitment + replay-safe consumer"]
    task["12. Approved external setup task<br/>independent from financial success"]
    intent --> facts
    facts --> check
    check --> valid
    valid --> offer
    offer --> approve
    approve --> create
    create --> buyerpp
    buyerpp --> commit
    commit --> send
    send --> result
    result -->|completed capture| confirmed
    confirmed --> outbox
    outbox --> task
    valid -->|no| revise
    revise -->|new version| facts
    result -->|ambiguous| unknown
    unknown -->|resource evidence| result
    result -->|terminal no effect| declined
